stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Pending: POST /api/duels
    Pending --> Left: human pick, or judge says A
    Pending --> Right: human pick, or judge says B
    Pending --> Tie: judge says Tie
    Pending --> Expired: 24 h deadline passes
    Pending --> Left: walkover — right side failed
    Pending --> Right: walkover — left side failed
    Pending --> Pending: judge stood down<br/>(rate-limited, unparseable,<br/>BOTH models failed)

    Left --> [*]: Elo ±K, EloHistory x2
    Right --> [*]: Elo ±K, EloHistory x2
    Tie --> [*]: DrawCount++, Elo unchanged
    Expired --> [*]: no Elo movement

    note right of Pending
        A second verdict write throws
        InvalidOperationException → HTTP 409.
        First write wins, always.
    end note
